    "title": "IEEE ITSS R8 Joint Chapters Meetings 2026",
    "description": "<p>This is a joint technical activity in London and online. It is co-organised by the IEEE Chapter UK/Ireland and IEEE Chapter Benelux Chapter ITSS. It aims to exchange knowledge and experience in developing automated driving systems, and implementing responsible AI at scale for future mobility. A social networking opportunity will also be offered for the IEEE ITSS membership engagement. On-line participation is highly encouraged.</p>",
