    "id": 561706,
    "title": "IEEE Italy Section Biometrics Council Chapter PhD Award 2026",
    "description": "<p>The IEEE Italy Section Biometrics Council Chapter has launched a call for <strong><span style=\"color: #9d241e;\">PhD Award 2026</span></strong>, in recognition of the best PhD Thesis discussed at an Italian University in the field of Biometric Recognition.</p>\r\n<p>For the 2026 award, the Committee has considered <strong>PhD Theses defended in the period from January 2025 to the deadline of the call, set at </strong><strong>October 2nd, 2026</strong><strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p>The award will consist of <strong>a diploma and a monetary prize of &euro; 500 </strong>for the author of the best Thesis.</p>\r\n<p>Details were reported at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ieee-biometrics.org/chapters/italy-chapter/\">https://ieee-biometrics.org/chapters/italy-chapter/</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>The winner will be announced during a dedicated event, currently planned for November 20, 2026.</p>",
